-- #974 (2026-10-28): walk paths into ship docks that end in the water (playerbots DB).
--
-- Run mop1k-v8-1028 (1000 bots, first hour): 4 boardings from the water (type 15, z < 2: Standrin / Delphilla /
-- Taralas at Booty Bay 20808, Rogrormuth at Stormwind 176310) and the Valiance Keep dock-wait-timeout (Lentha, 190536).
-- A ship dock node is the ship origin on the sea (TravelNode.cpp transport nodes), and many stored walk paths into it
-- (AC WotLK data) swim their last 5-150 points: the bot waits in the water beside the ship and the #948 pier walk has
-- to get it out; at Booty Bay it cannot (the navmesh joins that water to the pier only over the mountain, 1240 yd).
-- Audit of every walk link into a boat dock (offline Detour over the 5.4.8 mmaps, the #964 tools in
-- (not shipped): a path point is wet when its nearest walkable poly (3 yd / 5 yd box)
-- is a water poly.
--  * Rebuilt: links whose two ends the navmesh joins without one water poly, at most 2x the old length or the old
--    length + 400 yd: Detour A* (bot filter, water cost 20) from the source node to a stand point on the pier from
--    which the docked ship was boarded in the 2026-10-27/28 logs, points every <= 15 yd, then the dock node itself as
--    the last point (AC: a path ends at its end node). The bot stops on the pier, inside the 35 yd dock radius, and
--    boards from there. distance / swim_distance by AC TravelNodePath::calculateCost (the last segment, pier -> node
--    on the sea, counts as swim). type / object / extra_cost / max_creature_* keep their values.
--  * Deleted: links whose only way into the dock is through the water (the dry navmesh alternative also has water
--    polys or is more than 2x longer). Every source keeps other links and still reaches the dock, and the dock still
--    reaches it (graph check over all links).
--  * Not touched: 2912 The Great Sea -> 2032 (2912 has no other link), the Sister Mercy / turtle / Azuremyst docks (no
--    stand point seen yet), zeppelin towers (dry).
-- Stand points:
--    1899 Ship (The Maidens Fancy) (transport 20808) map 1 (-1002.7,-3826.9,5.4): Ratchet pier: end of paths 388 / 389 / 3136 -> 1899
--    1900 Ship (The Maidens Fancy) (transport 20808) map 0 (-14279.2,571.5,6.1): Booty Bay pier: end of path 355 -> 1900; ambient boards at (-14279.2,571.5,6.1) / (-14279.4,571.2,5.8)
--    1961 Ship (The Bravery) (transport 176310) map 0 (-8644.7,1334.2,5.6): Stormwind pier (The Bravery): end of path 2465 -> 1961; ambient board at (-8644.1,1333.4,5.6)
--    1962 Ship (The Bravery) (transport 176310) map 1 (8176.6,1005.4,6.5): Rutheran pier (The Bravery): FindPierPoint pick of the 176310 waits there
--    1970 Ship, Icebreaker (Northspear) (transport 181688) map 571 (587,-5105.4,5.4): Kamagua pier: end of path 3658 -> 1970
--    2032 Ship, Icebreaker (Stormwinds Pride) (transport 190536) map 0 (-8287.5,1410.6,4.8): Stormwind pier (Stormwinds Pride): Aristando leave point; Board boards at (-8289.4,1415.4,7.5) / (-8286.7,1414.8,8.2)
--    2033 Ship, Icebreaker (Stormwinds Pride) (transport 190536) map 571 (2225.4,5131.7,5.3): Valiance Keep pier: FindPierPoint pick of every 190536 wait there; Board boards at (2228.5,5126.8,5.5) / (2229.1,5126.9,3.8)
